    "body": "LGTM with final token nit. I can work on reviewing the tests if you think they're ready. But it'd be great to have @ricea and/or @nidhijaju confirm this is a good direction.\r\n\r\nGiven Safari and Firefox haven't yet implemented readable byte streams I'm comfortable calling this a bugfix that falls under their general already-expressed interest in readable byte streams, as long as we get at least a Chromium sanity check. Of course Safari and Firefox engineer review and thoughts would be highly welcome if they have the time!",
